{"name":"Hunting Boots","hex":"#6b5a54","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"hunting","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of finding and killing a wild animal, either for sport or with the intention of using its parts to make food, clothes, etc.","The act of looking for something, especially for a job or flat."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of hunt"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hunting"},{"term":"boots","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of boot"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A condom."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/boots"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hunting","blocks":[{"text":"Hunting is the human practice of seeking, pursuing, capturing, and/or killing wildlife or feral animals. The most common reasons for humans to hunt are to obtain the animal's body to consume their meat and useful animal products, for recreation/taxidermy, although it may also be done for other purposes such as removing predators dangerous to humans or domestic animals, to eliminate pests and nuisance animals that damage crops/livestock/poultry or spread diseases, for trade/tourism, or for ecological conservation against overpopulation and invasive species."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Paul_Childerley_driven_hunt_Finland_04.png/330px-Paul_Childerley_driven_hunt_Finland_04.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hunting","wikidata":"Q36963"},{"title":"Boot","blocks":[{"text":"A boot is a type of footwear. Most boots mainly cover the foot and the ankle, while some also cover some part of the lower calf. Some boots extend up the leg, sometimes as far as the knee or even the hip. Most boots have a heel that is clearly distinguishable from the rest of the sole, even if the two are made of one piece. Traditionally made of leather or rubber, modern boots are made from a variety of materials."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Cliff_Climbers_Combat_boot_Shoes_Blast.png/330px-Cliff_Climbers_Combat_boot_Shoes_Blast.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boot","wikidata":"Q190868"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Bogenj%C3%A4ger_auf_der_Lockjagd.jpg/500px-Bogenj%C3%A4ger_auf_der_Lockjagd.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Bogenj%C3%A4ger_auf_der_Lockjagd.jpg/1280px-Bogenj%C3%A4ger_auf_der_Lockjagd.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Bogenj%C3%A4ger_auf_der_Lockjagd.jpg/500px-Bogenj%C3%A4ger_auf_der_Lockjagd.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bowhunter with a compound bow using a call","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABogenj%C3%A4ger_auf_der_Lockjagd.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Professional_stalker_standing_next_to_red_deer_stag_Ardnamurchan_Estate_Scotland_darker_01.png/500px-Professional_stalker_standing_next_to_red_deer_stag_Ardnamurchan_Estate_Scotland_darker_01.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Professional_stalker_standing_next_to_red_deer_stag_Ardnamurchan_Estate_Scotland_darker_01.png/1280px-Professional_stalker_standing_next_to_red_deer_stag_Ardnamurchan_Estate_Scotland_darker_01.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Professional_stalker_standing_next_to_red_deer_stag_Ardnamurchan_Estate_Scotland_darker_01.png/500px-Professional_stalker_standing_next_to_red_deer_stag_A